From: XG2010G OpenWrt maintainers <xg2010g@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: add dedicated EPON OAM consumer

Route EPON OAM frames through a dedicated RCU consumer instead of OMCI.
Preserve the SDK LLID metadata contract and transmit OAM on queue 7 with
matching channel/NBOQ. Keep GPON OMCI, XGS OMCC and EPON OAM ownership
mutually exclusive and require a live OAM consumer before exposing LLIDs.

Signed-off-by: XG2010G OpenWrt maintainers <xg2010g@example.invalid>
---
